// Dialog :
"P4246453810" "Are you telling me that Requiem is still alive somewhere on that world of werewolves? The only human left? Or half human, anyway. I hear Requiem is like Arakhn: half human, half Nictus. That degree of solitude be a hard cross to bear, even for someone as private as Requiem. Guess I can't feel too sorry for him, though. After all, he brought that doom on himself."
// RandomFameString :
"P1319673347" "{HeroName} said something about a world full of werewolves. Sounds like crazy talk to me."

